# A binding of lba.cfg, with GamePad (fixtures/rebind: the outside
# save, and its LBA.CFG ending in Input0_1: 90 and Input0_2: 0, Forward
# on Z alone). In play Z walks Twinsen forward, and Up, bound to none of
# the inputs, leaves him standing.

hold 0.15
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot scene
down z
sleep 1.5
up z
sleep 1
shot walked
down Up
sleep 1.5
up Up
sleep 1
shot stood
